Time Complexity:
O(n²)

Space Complexity:
O(1)

Approach:
1. Traverse the array using index i
2. For each element, compare it with all subsequent elements using index j
3. Check if nums[i] equals nums[j]
4. If a duplicate is found, return true
5. Continue checking all pairs if no duplicate is found
6. If the traversal completes, return false


class Solution {
    public boolean containsDuplicate(int[] nums) {
        for(int i=0; i<nums.length-1; i++){
            for(int j=i+1; j<nums.length; j++){
                if(nums[i]==nums[j]) return true;
            }
        }
        return false;
    }
}
